  "details": "This is a QOL suggestion, that would save time and provide more convinience.\n\nI've attached a Mockup picture below.\n\nIn the VRChat Avatar Parameter in the Inspector tab, add a checkbox next to every parameter.\n\nOn the bottom, add a button with \"add parameters to a [selected playable layer]\".\n\nThe [selected playable layer] should be a dropdown menu that you select between base, action, fx etc layers.\n\nThis can save a lot of time manually copying parameters to controllers.",
